{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EXEWsoiz2Xni7MmxqoT8w2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Planning\n2\t\n3\tThis folder contains project roadmaps, task management, and planning artifacts for the QuantAgent system.\n4\t\n5\t## Reading Order\n6\t\n7\tAgents working in this repository should read planning documents in this order:\n8\t\n9\t1. **Current Phase Roadmaps** (start here)\n10\t   - [phase1_roadmap.md](./phase1_roadmap.md) - Phase 1 development plan and milestones\n11\t   - [phase2_roadmap.md](./phase2_roadmap.md) - Phase 2 development plan and milestones\n12\t\n13\t## Current Truth\n14\t\n15\tThe roadmap files represent the current development phases and priorities. When planning work:\n16\t\n17\t- Consult the relevant phase roadmap for context\n18\t- Align new tasks with phase objectives\n19\t- Use Beads (`bd ready`) to view current backlog and ready tasks\n20\t\n21\t## Active Per-Change Planning\n22\t\n23\t- [QuantAgent-r78-PL-trade-pnl-calculation.md](./QuantAgent-r78-PL-trade-pnl-calculation.md) - Trade P&L calculation bug fix (P1)\n24\t- [QuantAgent-les-PL-commissions-pnl.md](./QuantAgent-les-PL-commissions-pnl.md) - Support commissions in P&L calculation (P3, feature)\n25\t- [QuantAgent-nu7-PL-active-position-monitoring.md](./QuantAgent-nu7-PL-active-position-monitoring.md) - Active Position Monitoring System (Epic: QuantAgent-nu7)\n26\t- [QuantAgent-8vb-backtest-analysis.md](./QuantAgent-8vb-backtest-analysis.md) - Backtest log analysis (P0 bugs identified)\n27\t- [QuantAgent-7bn-PL-azure-openai-support.md](./QuantAgent-7bn-PL-azure-openai-support.md) - Azure OpenAI LLM provider support\n28\t- [QuantAgent-ou3-spx-data-fetch.md](./QuantAgent-ou3-spx-data-fetch.md) - SPX/yfinance intraday data fix (P2)\n29\t- [QuantAgent-lmn-deprecated-parameter.md](./QuantAgent-lmn-deprecated-parameter.md) - Deprecated wait_sec cleanup (P3)\n30\t\n31\t## Per-Change Planning Documents\n32\t\n33\tPer-change planning documents should follow this naming convention:\n34\t\n35\t```\n36\tQuantAgent-<issue-id>-PL-<short-slug>.md\n37\t```\n38\t\n39\tExample: `QuantAgent-a3f2dd-PL-backtest-optimization.md`\n40\t\n41\tThese files describe planning deltas, task breakdowns, and execution strategies for specific changes linked to Beads issues (when applicable for system implementations).\n42\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce2496a8-a497-4f7a-9d36-07ca768dd87e","uuid":"16001a9e-e153-4f1b-ac9e-818c54b83a34","timestamp":"2026-05-05T00:52:49.333Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/autodev-worktrees/QuantAgent/QuantAgent-c69/planner-20260505T005036Z/docs/02_planning/README.md","content":"# Planning\n\nThis folder contains project roadmaps, task management, and planning artifacts for the QuantAgent system.\n\n## Reading Order\n\nAgents working in this repository should read planning documents in this order:\n\n1. **Current Phase Roadmaps** (start here)\n   - [phase1_roadmap.md](./phase1_roadmap.md) - Phase 1 development plan and milestones\n   - [phase2_roadmap.md](./phase2_roadmap.md) - Phase 2 development plan and milestones\n\n## Current Truth\n\nThe roadmap files represent the current development phases and priorities. When planning work:\n\n- Consult the relevant phase roadmap for context\n- Align new tasks with phase objectives\n- Use Beads (`bd ready`) to view current backlog and ready tasks\n\n## Active Per-Change Planning\n\n- [QuantAgent-r78-PL-trade-pnl-calculation.md](./QuantAgent-r78-PL-trade-pnl-calculation.md) - Trade P&L calculation bug fix (P1)\n- [QuantAgent-les-PL-commissions-pnl.md](./QuantAgent-les-PL-commissions-pnl.md) - Support commissions in P&L calculation (P3, feature)\n- [QuantAgent-nu7-PL-active-position-monitoring.md](./QuantAgent-nu7-PL-active-position-monitoring.md) - Active Position Monitoring System (Epic: QuantAgent-nu7)\n- [QuantAgent-8vb-backtest-analysis.md](./QuantAgent-8vb-backtest-analysis.md) - Backtest log analysis (P0 bugs identified)\n- [QuantAgent-7bn-PL-azure-openai-support.md](./QuantAgent-7bn-PL-azure-openai-support.md) - Azure OpenAI LLM provider support\n- [QuantAgent-ou3-spx-data-fetch.md](./QuantAgent-ou3-spx-data-fetch.md) - SPX/yfinance intraday data fix (P2)\n- [QuantAgent-lmn-deprecated-parameter.md](./QuantAgent-lmn-deprecated-parameter.md) - Deprecated wait_sec cleanup (P3)\n\n## Per-Change Planning Documents\n\nPer-change planning documents should follow this naming convention:\n\n```\nQuantAgent-<issue-id>-PL-<short-slug>.md\n```\n\nExample: `QuantAgent-a3f2dd-PL-backtest-optimization.md`\n\nThese files describe planning deltas, task breakdowns, and execution strategies for specific changes linked to Beads issues (when applicable for system implementations).\n","numLines":42,"startLine":1,"totalLines":42}}}
