{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018Nr44VBy64qnT647axpCXm","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Acceptance Tests & Criteria\n2\t\n3\tThis folder contains acceptance criteria, test oracles, and manual test cases for validating system behavior.\n4\t\n5\t## Reading Order\n6\t\n7\tAgents working in this repository should read acceptance test documents in this order:\n8\t\n9\t### Current Test Cases\n10\t- [MVP_MANUAL_TEST_CASES.md](./MVP_MANUAL_TEST_CASES.md) - Manual test cases for MVP validation\n11\t\n12\t## Current Truth\n13\t\n14\tAcceptance test documents define the criteria for validating that features work as intended. When implementing or testing features:\n15\t\n16\t- Review relevant acceptance criteria before implementation\n17\t- Execute manual test cases to validate behavior\n18\t- Update test cases when requirements change\n19\t- Automate manual tests where feasible (see `tests/` directory)\n20\t\n21\t## Active Per-Change Acceptance Criteria\n22\t\n23\t- [QuantAgent-94d-AC-backtest-isolation.md](./QuantAgent-94d-AC-backtest-isolation.md) - Backtest Run ID Isolation (P1, bug)\n24\t- [QuantAgent-r78-AC-trade-pnl-calculation.md](./QuantAgent-r78-AC-trade-pnl-calculation.md) - Trade P&L calculation bug fix (P1)\n25\t- [QuantAgent-les-AC-commissions-pnl.md](./QuantAgent-les-AC-commissions-pnl.md) - Support commissions in P&L calculation (P3, feature)\n26\t- [QuantAgent-nu7-AC-active-position-monitoring.md](./QuantAgent-nu7-AC-active-position-monitoring.md) - Active Position Monitoring System (Epic: QuantAgent-nu7)\n27\t- [QuantAgent-7bn-AC-azure-openai-support.md](./QuantAgent-7bn-AC-azure-openai-support.md) - Azure OpenAI LLM provider support\n28\t\n29\t## Acceptance Criteria Format\n30\t\n31\tAcceptance criteria should follow Given/When/Then format:\n32\t\n33\t```\n34\tGiven [initial context]\n35\tWhen [action or event]\n36\tThen [expected outcome]\n37\t```\n38\t\n39\tExample:\n40\t```\n41\tGiven a user has an open long position\n42\tWhen the market price drops below the stop-loss level\n43\tThen the position should be automatically closed\n44\t```\n45\t\n46\t## Per-Change Acceptance Documents\n47\t\n48\tPer-change acceptance documents should follow this naming convention:\n49\t\n50\t```\n51\tQuantAgent-<issue-id>-AC-<short-slug>.md\n52\t```\n53\t\n54\tExample: `QuantAgent-a3f2dd-AC-risk-limits.md`\n55\t\n56\tThese files describe acceptance criteria and test oracles for specific changes linked to Beads issues (when applicable for system implementations).\n57\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce2496a8-a497-4f7a-9d36-07ca768dd87e","uuid":"0a4811fb-0f00-4612-a8aa-18abb4d414c9","timestamp":"2026-05-05T00:52:55.286Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/autodev-worktrees/QuantAgent/QuantAgent-c69/planner-20260505T005036Z/docs/05_acceptance_tests/README.md","content":"# Acceptance Tests & Criteria\n\nThis folder contains acceptance criteria, test oracles, and manual test cases for validating system behavior.\n\n## Reading Order\n\nAgents working in this repository should read acceptance test documents in this order:\n\n### Current Test Cases\n- [MVP_MANUAL_TEST_CASES.md](./MVP_MANUAL_TEST_CASES.md) - Manual test cases for MVP validation\n\n## Current Truth\n\nAcceptance test documents define the criteria for validating that features work as intended. When implementing or testing features:\n\n- Review relevant acceptance criteria before implementation\n- Execute manual test cases to validate behavior\n- Update test cases when requirements change\n- Automate manual tests where feasible (see `tests/` directory)\n\n## Active Per-Change Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [QuantAgent-94d-AC-backtest-isolation.md](./QuantAgent-94d-AC-backtest-isolation.md) - Backtest Run ID Isolation (P1, bug)\n- [QuantAgent-r78-AC-trade-pnl-calculation.md](./QuantAgent-r78-AC-trade-pnl-calculation.md) - Trade P&L calculation bug fix (P1)\n- [QuantAgent-les-AC-commissions-pnl.md](./QuantAgent-les-AC-commissions-pnl.md) - Support commissions in P&L calculation (P3, feature)\n- [QuantAgent-nu7-AC-active-position-monitoring.md](./QuantAgent-nu7-AC-active-position-monitoring.md) - Active Position Monitoring System (Epic: QuantAgent-nu7)\n- [QuantAgent-7bn-AC-azure-openai-support.md](./QuantAgent-7bn-AC-azure-openai-support.md) - Azure OpenAI LLM provider support\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Format\n\nAcceptance criteria should follow Given/When/Then format:\n\n```\nGiven [initial context]\nWhen [action or event]\nThen [expected outcome]\n```\n\nExample:\n```\nGiven a user has an open long position\nWhen the market price drops below the stop-loss level\nThen the position should be automatically closed\n```\n\n## Per-Change Acceptance Documents\n\nPer-change acceptance documents should follow this naming convention:\n\n```\nQuantAgent-<issue-id>-AC-<short-slug>.md\n```\n\nExample: `QuantAgent-a3f2dd-AC-risk-limits.md`\n\nThese files describe acceptance criteria and test oracles for specific changes linked to Beads issues (when applicable for system implementations).\n","numLines":57,"startLine":1,"totalLines":57}}}
