{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Gfah6WqossSZhyKJ5UZumh","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Phase 1 Roadmap: MVP Paper Trading System\n2\t\n3\t**Duration**: 8-10 weeks\n4\t**Goal**: Fully automated paper trading system with validated strategy performance\n5\t**Key Focus**: Backtesting + Paper Trading validation (not real broker integration)\n6\t\n7\t---\n8\t\n9\t## Timeline Overview\n10\t\n11\t```\n12\tWeek 1-2:   Database + Core Infrastructure (+ Docker setup)\n13\tWeek 3-4:   Portfolio + Risk Management\n14\tWeek 5-6:   Paper Broker + Order Execution\n15\tWeek 7-8:   Backtesting Engine + Data Caching\n16\tWeek 9-10:  Streamlit Dashboard + Integration Testing\n17\t```\n18\t\n19\t**Total MVP**: 8-10 weeks (vs 12 in original plan)\n20\t\n21\t---\n22\t\n23\t## Phase 1 Architecture (What We're Building)\n24\t\n25\t```\n26\tData Layer\n27\t  ├─ yfinance (live)\n28\t  └─ Local DB cache (historical)\n29\t          ↓\n30\tAnalysis Engine (REFACTORED QuantAgent)\n31\t  ├─ Indicator Subgraph (structured output)\n32\t  ├─ Pattern Subgraph (structured output)\n33\t  ├─ Trend Subgraph (structured output)\n34\t  └─ Decision Agent (consumes structured data)\n35\t          ↓\n36\tBacktester (NEW)\n37\t  ├─ Loop through dates\n38\t  ├─ Execute analysis\n39\t  ├─ Measure performance\n40\t  └─ Validate strategy\n41\t          ↓\n42\tPaper Trader (NEW)\n43\t  ├─ Schedule hourly\n44\t  ├─ Execute decisions\n45\t  ├─ Track portfolio\n46\t  └─ Monitor risk\n47\t          ↓\n48\tDatabase (NEW)\n49\t  ├─ Persist trades\n50\t  ├─ Store signals\n51\t  ├─ Checkpoints (LangGraph state history)\n52\t  └─ Audit trail\n53\t          ↓\n54\tDashboard (Streamlit)\n55\t  ├─ Live metrics\n56\t  ├─ Backtest results\n57\t  └─ Trade history\n58\t```\n59\t\n60\t**LangGraph Improvements Integrated**:"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce2496a8-a497-4f7a-9d36-07ca768dd87e","uuid":"2ee303b0-d882-4c16-9bda-a78633b1e696","timestamp":"2026-05-05T00:53:00.748Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/autodev-worktrees/QuantAgent/QuantAgent-c69/planner-20260505T005036Z/docs/02_planning/phase1_roadmap.md","content":"# Phase 1 Roadmap: MVP Paper Trading System\n\n**Duration**: 8-10 weeks\n**Goal**: Fully automated paper trading system with validated strategy performance\n**Key Focus**: Backtesting + Paper Trading validation (not real broker integration)\n\n---\n\n## Timeline Overview\n\n```\nWeek 1-2:   Database + Core Infrastructure (+ Docker setup)\nWeek 3-4:   Portfolio + Risk Management\nWeek 5-6:   Paper Broker + Order Execution\nWeek 7-8:   Backtesting Engine + Data Caching\nWeek 9-10:  Streamlit Dashboard + Integration Testing\n```\n\n**Total MVP**: 8-10 weeks (vs 12 in original plan)\n\n---\n\n## Phase 1 Architecture (What We're Building)\n\n```\nData Layer\n  ├─ yfinance (live)\n  └─ Local DB cache (historical)\n          ↓\nAnalysis Engine (REFACTORED QuantAgent)\n  ├─ Indicator Subgraph (structured output)\n  ├─ Pattern Subgraph (structured output)\n  ├─ Trend Subgraph (structured output)\n  └─ Decision Agent (consumes structured data)\n          ↓\nBacktester (NEW)\n  ├─ Loop through dates\n  ├─ Execute analysis\n  ├─ Measure performance\n  └─ Validate strategy\n          ↓\nPaper Trader (NEW)\n  ├─ Schedule hourly\n  ├─ Execute decisions\n  ├─ Track portfolio\n  └─ Monitor risk\n          ↓\nDatabase (NEW)\n  ├─ Persist trades\n  ├─ Store signals\n  ├─ Checkpoints (LangGraph state history)\n  └─ Audit trail\n          ↓\nDashboard (Streamlit)\n  ├─ Live metrics\n  ├─ Backtest results\n  └─ Trade history\n```\n\n**LangGraph Improvements Integrated**:","numLines":60,"startLine":1,"totalLines":730}}}
